        <p>MONEY.-210 TO £soo.—Money.—Cash advanCed to all respectable Householders, Farmers, Tradesmenftlihnp- keepers, and to all classes worthy of credit, in 11111713 varying from £lO, £l5, 220, tO/£.sof and upwards on written promise to repay, with or without sureties. To be repaid by Weekly, Fortnightly, or Monthly Instalments, Distance no object. Letters promptly attended to. Apply personally or by letter to the CEO wri ADVANCE CO., 6, Brown-street, Market-street, Manchester.</p>
