        <head>CAMDEN v. BRUNSWICK.</head>
        <p>CAMDEN v. BRUNSWICK.</p>
        <p>The Guild Recreation branches of the shove played their return match at the Camden Rnnms, Runcorn,last Friday evening. Great intereEt was talv,n in the event, a large number of young men from each club being present. Brunswick showed a considerable improve- ment in their pay, and several of the games were very keenly contested. Six couples took part am before. The resuL was a draw, each side having won three games. Below are the separate result; : Draws</p>
